        "pp_expandable_r43w6T": {
          "type": "pp-expandable",
          "settings": {
            "pp_expandable_title1": "🚚 Shipping",
            "pp_expandable_content1": "<p><p>Enjoy insured shipping on all orders. We process orders within 1-3 business days before dispatching. Upon shipment, the anticipated delivery times are as follows:</p><ul><li>USA: 3-7 business days</li><li>UK: 7-18 business days</li><li>Australia: 7-18 business days</li><li>Canada: 7-18 business days</li><li>Europe: 7-18 business days</li><li>Rest of world: 14-20 business days</li></ul></p>",
            "pp_expandable_title2": "📦 Returns",
            "pp_expandable_content2": "<p><p>We are certain you will adore our products, just as we do! If, however, things do not work out as expected, our return and refund policy is crafted to simplify the process for you. You can return the product for a full refund within 30 days of purchase.</p></p>",
            "pp_expandable_title3": "🏅 Money Back Guarantee",
            "pp_expandable_content3": "<p><p>You can try our products risk-free with our 30-day Money-Back Guarantee. If you are not completely satisfied, simply return it for a full refund.</p></p>",
            "pp_expandable_text_size": "medium",
            "pp_expandable_answer_size": "small",
